      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hermès introduces the Bolide 1923 Mini for Fall/Winter 2026, complete with a Clou de Forge jewelry chain that fuses silversmithing and leathercraft. At its center, 23 hand-assembled silver links are set with gold horseshoe studs, creating a jewel-like sparkle against the black calfskin.",
