    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag made its debut at the Hermès Fall/Winter 2026 womenswear show, a collection inspired by Hecate, the Greek goddess of the underworld and witchcraft. The ready-to-wear pieces blend riding breeches, riding boots, and military jackets to conjure a bold, mysterious, forward-charging female knight.",
