    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Bolide 1923 Mini is the latest size introduced by the brand in 2011, and the smallest member of the Bolide family. Measuring just 18×14×7cm, it is compact and lightweight whether carried by hand or worn crossbody.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/6nw97hu/f9d496dbb99f3955.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/6nw97hu/1948bbcb473d3ded.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Hermès Bolide Mini On Wheels bag",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The body is crafted from black Evergrain calfskin, a leather that is fine, supple, and subtly grained, developing a warm natural sheen over time. The entire bag weighs only 200 grams, feeling virtually weightless when worn.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
