      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The entire chain is hand-assembled from 23 silver-plated brass links, into which artisans forge and set gold horseshoe nails, then secure it to the shoulder strap using leather braiding techniques. The gold and silver metals create a shimmering interplay, looking especially dazzling against the black background.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
