    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· What Fits Inside? ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Despite its mini size, the Bolide offers impressive capacity, easily accommodating a standard smartphone. The flat base is set with four silver metal feet, while leather piping keeps the body structured and resistant to deformation. The zip pull also subtly incorporates an H monogram, with every detail executed to perfection.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
