    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We placed an iPhone Pro-sized phone, a bi-fold wallet, tissues, a cardholder, keys, lipstick, and perfume inside. The dual handles look vintage and elegant when carried by hand, while the shoulder strap makes it relaxed and casual crossbody, with the jewelry chain adding a highlight to the overall look.",
