    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hermès is a world-renowned French luxury brand known for its handcrafted leather goods and handbags. Founded by Thierry Hermès in 1837, it began as a workshop specializing in harnesses, shifted its focus to leather goods and handbags in the early 20th century, and gradually expanded into scarves, fragrances, fashion, jewelry, and watches. Its classic handbag styles include the Kelly Bag and the Birkin Bag. since 1837 from Paris",
      "url": null,
